 news:['Keep the signature','The newspaper is retained as a distinct Garage destination. Common navigation stays predictable.',['Next story actually changes the article.','The paper’s racing action opens the relevant circuit.']],
 editor:['Guide the first creation','A small four-step example demonstrates onboarding inside the existing creation journey.',['Road, start line, test and publish are connected steps.','This is a menu-flow illustration, not a functioning map editor.']],
